#: scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 806dfbf980bca4a097d6a84a900b7672b550f7c155b3976eea1be1c498dace61
#. default-sha256: 95258c459cf9db310dc6d013f1a73b5fb3145f2820aefb64a886a874568424f9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫As I am sure "
"you’re aware,⟪k:15⟫our parents arranged our marriage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Como eu tenho "
"certeza que você está ciente,⟪k:15⟫nossos pais arranjaram nosso casamento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cad6462af3c2e9a85457423d2cd896ecd547434a4b03a07759fd8c2836e791c
#. default-sha256: 6383aa68ba6beed9dc9a3e176815415fe0292956658155d07904e0240c220271
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Before I emigrated to this country to be married,⟪k:1⟫I lived in a misty island nation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Antes de emigrar para este país para me casar,⟪k:1⟫Eu morava em uma nação insular enevoada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2eeca989b5f3fa3a4a94d9430b1bb23b9b846175398ff248e227a2a1442d773
#. default-sha256: 439f9ef29ecfa1dae96e08b17d8b61168d50e39e8229c3d0b89cc426a97878e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Portraits of my ancestors hung in the house where I lived; ⟪k:1⟫I remember as a child "
"wincing in fear at the sight of them staring down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na casa onde eu morava havia, pendurados, retratos de meus ancestrais; ⟪k:1⟫ Lembro-me de, "
"quando criança, estremecer de medo ao vê-los olhando para mim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47e0f47327de0e85dba0b44c245eb6f087ad43903823d97799ded9e882a3ec3e
#. default-sha256: 79ea1ee91c6ee8adbf05ddfe23c7c5b58a233634eb786b9f489f0d4dade89141
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mother and father were constantly telling me to show them respect, as it was their hard "
"work that kept our bloodline alive and well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Minha mãe e meu pai constantemente me diziam para mostrar respeito a eles, pois era seu "
"trabalho duro que mantinha nossa linhagem viva e bem."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab023fd0e24072706afc6304b67b054588828ed299490626cfedec516fdfb98b
#. default-sha256: 51279eb5ed7c0328ee64907b09867272f24c0bf66df77700ba5bbb4aca924cc4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, they were fighting an uphill battle to do the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No entanto, eles estavam lutando uma batalha difícil para fazer o mesmo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91f0706051632a70034045957cac97144af0dd312e9841697f40413b4c98a98a
#. default-sha256: f7267142383f71f40d288cd7f31419d4e03e61ae569c00e1e6044c09167877ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would have been clear to anyone reasonably perceptive that our house was coming tumbling "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Teria ficado claro para qualquer pessoa razoavelmente perceptiva que nossa casa estava "
"desmoronando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a750a3b9217653545d44cf2be2999cca57eaf48f723975b9f402e9ec34e6a5ab
#. default-sha256: 3e09acbf67a2ff6865df5048b7f8d9b96b02e2d20cc64800d5530a1da42f3189
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Valuable furniture and paintings slowly disappeared, and eventually, the portraits were gone "
"too."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Móveis e pinturas valiosas desapareciam lentamente e, eventualmente, os retratos também."

#: scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21a87fa27da9808e9bc17fba6b74edc1c8de11eb3b9306337af8619ddb5e53aa
#. default-sha256: c2df7c28c34c7f269ddadeb5eea455402356bbd922c5a251a10037fe575a7ba0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As our house collapsed, so too did my parents’ health deteriorate, robbing us of any source "
"of income."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫À medida que nossa casa desmoronava, a saúde de meus pais também se deteriorou, roubando-nos "
"qualquer fonte de renda."

#: scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 657dd7a9056f72b6e5627b7418cd3532b1a6863c2d3ed8f429c63cdb55e9976a
#. default-sha256: b95d52929503370d5567c13272869bf95e099c953f830e6114d6b884d0852c12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And though I was educated, I lacked the skills necessary to obtain work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E embora eu fosse instruída, não tinha as habilidades necessárias para conseguir trabalho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ae551beddb471e9fc3fe4f487c3641652ea1e872a4ce2c708ee5656c452f94c
#. default-sha256: f81636d91b088f39cfc77e6823f86f7a8225d9e7d8b98f5402b9c8a3da1618f9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just as we were about to run out of money and options, my parents received Jacopo’s parents’ "
"marriage proposition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando estávamos prestes a ficar sem dinheiro e opções, meus pais receberam a proposta de "
"casamento dos pais de Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e3b7bd2d880169b6f129278e95c90358dd426a5ad0292c6d2fb4759f6196dad
#. default-sha256: 0a5ecc89e30b9934951b7fba55172b5715d45803fd5cba112adf82b35f357fe0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Both of our families stood to benefit from the arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had social status, "
"and he had wealth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ambas as nossas famílias se beneficiariam com o acordo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu tinha status social, e "
"ele tinha riqueza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d81ef62c9e3e2287b456561f78a436423a2aa62df92994b08d05de1d42a542fd
#. default-sha256: 422be74789236f806e6a5cff1e72a8b7cff8271056fa1c4290600893be2dfd06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We each had what the other lacked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cada um de nós tinha o que faltava ao outro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 742ec78e4e4268fe1d9e9bcf6770216635092424b009ae1fb8acdd243f4d0b58
#. default-sha256: 3f30c9b252be9ced5f53454479cac97d733fc4564789b689ddcf2b09afd1c4ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One needs more than money to make it in the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Without at least a semi-"
"reputable name attached to you,⟪k:3⟫you’re liable to get laughed out of most social gatherings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫É preciso mais do que dinheiro para ter sucesso no mundo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sem pelo menos um nome "
"semi-respeitável ligado a você,⟪k:3⟫você está sujeito a ser ridicularizado na maioria das "
"reuniões sociais."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e91baf724375436cacb1a582f7015edec666f6c7ed15eef95b91400bd52a4838
#. default-sha256: 623583c6b05042b8ed5493a24b2e1b1a97990884df7d33159cfbf64d62cab6b0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I first met Jacopo here, in this country.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We didn’t even know what the other looked "
"like until our wedding day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Encontrei Jacopo pela primeira vez aqui, neste país.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nós nem sabíamos como o outro "
"era até o dia do nosso casamento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 822149f291ac26ea509e723d5f0abf51a1396bbb41c855806e9cbc50f00533ab
#. default-sha256: 73dae9e3e20153b5691a15fbd0782556829179ea52b80efc8d4f83be1fc1206c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To be quite honest, I was scared to death at first.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was so nervous. What kind of "
"man would he be?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was I to be wed to some middle-aged stranger?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Para ser bem honesta, eu estava morrendo de medo no começo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu estava tão nervosa. "
"Que tipo de homem ele seria?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu deveria me casar com algum estranho de meia-idade?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47ef6edd88e5e1bb57db41d5dd2a1fc13e2944d7c163e3e952b238dc4685e1d2
#. default-sha256: 464311b4557a71a230245cd83fda5495a35a294a83d9bf1061a96d774e494e69
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were not marrying because we had fallen in love like a normal couple."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não estávamos nos casando porque nos apaixonamos como um casal normal."

#: scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd316f4f80df17f2eea6c64e834e55204484fc1a2f517bb9e319cbf57f3c8e2c
#. default-sha256: d64d233579046066859209c4ae45a83058b2358099c300e2933a84c4cafad60b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I was in no position to be concerned with such things,⟪k:1⟫but when I thought about "
"our future, I shook with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sabia que não estava em posição de me preocupar com essas coisas,⟪k:1⟫mas quando pensei "
"sobre nosso futuro, tremi de medo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91ee55d66cf7a2b4fb4ba71c6df214c1875b495bc7d98a05133cad19e9e8d274
#. default-sha256: a00c93fe187f9e437cd2322ef1fc77082e367bea78a10bcf18468d334873bec0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the man I saw through my veil at the wedding was remarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas o homem que vi através do meu véu no casamento era impressionante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f235ecba091a159d3fe94dc0e216c9653efca598ac7e6c952195608eb8f0075d
#. default-sha256: a1295c8086ff47347425f7ed5529ae3c130ad32a4250d2906d4c5c8229050f46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was young, had strong, masculine eyes,⟪k:1⟫and at the same time, he too appeared nervous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele era jovem, tinha olhos fortes e masculinos,⟪k:1⟫e, ao mesmo tempo, ele também parecia "
"nervoso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21368f71cf3a9bc683fa8836272869d5dfa1955391d82f248bf3aa33f31a8545
#. default-sha256: f59f7db604258e6cb3b61b4b0df284dd749d1cc261247d182f99edda1de1e792
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫He was shaking as much—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, even more than me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Ele estava tremendo tanto quanto—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫não, ainda mais do que eu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9ff2751c51f84e6ec1262f340ae7344bac767108493e496cf76cdbf1cf4418b
#. default-sha256: 4a407dc352d47f1cd659e17ca7c8ee5e131f92b11a1aeb3f1459208e0f51084e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing that, the priest gave an impish little smirk when he asked Jacopo if he vowed his "
"eternal love to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vendo isso, o padre deu um sorrisinho travesso quando perguntou a Jacopo se ele jurava seu "
"amor eterno por mim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6704f78a7e972d2b523f5196ad00c2309198322aa07f72f3496bd1e07a77aa96
#. default-sha256: 1a3eb8f70084d9386f0d1f1aae8e26de16d773c1af667cc574e2558f7655b0eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫counted myself among the happy. ⟪k:2⟫And I still do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For in that moment, "
"I experienced true love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu...⟪k:1⟫me contava entre os felizes. ⟪k:2⟫E ainda conto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pois naquele momento, "
"experimentei o amor verdadeiro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 299bdf90997904b032779b9506679e003d9e2322fdeb0f382ff214f2ddaefd16
#. default-sha256: 4a2dc40fad4b6e5e6bc6327b92ffeb96505a95974b1c786829c2df92ef331f45
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You wanted to hear about when he was kind to me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, after the wedding, we "
"were given a week to ourselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Você queria ouvir sobre quando ele foi gentil comigo?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bem, depois do casamento, "
"nos deram uma semana sozinhos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87b8497369ad3c00301d41b40cfa0428bdfe855ed78664dad10a0449f4b56da9
#. default-sha256: 05a3a2d6a022eea9a6fdf910712481d304f7f1d8cc47227d96cc76c0926e5b01
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD31C664_E284_4A4B_82AA_884CB3236C8A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suppose you could call it a honeymoon, though we didn’t take a trip overseas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or "
"even go very far at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suponho que você poderia chamar de lua de mel, embora não tenhamos feito uma viagem ao "
"exterior—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ou mesmo ido muito longe.⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8212ea4fb49e5e09c97347861208f4542a6b879be41982623b85a2f5c6881aa
#. default-sha256: 85dc3a44e3b1738f073df62b633947dff0434bf205ec270f80efc636bdd4b0bf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3545ABA_5D3E_4590_BE8E_3ADF12576978"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He looked at me with uncertainty and asked:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele me olhou incerto e perguntou:"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D48F148_7278_46E4_8DF7_4D8AACB4C7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7370fa3b5c84de2e1085e0a22007e34036161f9efa804918f767a2ed3fe382b9
#. default-sha256: 40b7dbc58a23eb12ee006e1afc7ce54f059a9dbe895fb343daaf1cf893744d41
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8D48F148_7278_46E4_8DF7_4D8AACB4C7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Where would you like to go?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Onde você gostaria de ir?"

