msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0188FDA6_E178_40AB_9137_0037D28147C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then, as if he had forgotten about me until that moment,⟪k:1⟫he returned, grabbed me by "
"the arm, and led me to the carriage.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In retrospect, I realize he was not being very "
"gentlemanly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E então, como se tivesse se esquecido de mim até aquele momento,⟪k:1⟫ele voltou, me agarrou "
"pelo braço e me levou até a carruagem.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Em retrospecto, percebo que ele não estava sendo "
"muito cavalheiresco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C30CAAF0_A587_4AFF_A995_99B62A48DEAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ba4770ff2ae1df6a4696a2c20f7f3afd7a9362eaee212ca8eac4ca9dde190bf
