msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I was pleased that he was making any attempt to interact with me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eu estava feliz que ele, pelo menos, estava fazendo uma tentativa de interagir comigo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81975920_F28C_42F2_A838_235574DC5766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89f73453d142a472f5bff0e4768aff27230dafc7d9b387aba0a595e48aa10db9
