msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫As the carriage trotted down the streets, I saw so many new things. ⟪k:4⟫I "
"had spent most of my time cooped up inside at home, so it was like stepping into an entirely new "
"world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Enquanto a carruagem trotava pelas ruas, vi tantas coisas novas. ⟪k:4⟫Passei "
"a maior parte do meu tempo confinada em casa, então foi como entrar em um mundo totalmente novo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f156cc4885d01992f90355be6bbd22bef0c060e6aa043a6e49ba6dc44a3d76b
#. default-sha256: 6c4ee858c6f9667c1fa8bda7e1441239437d71f8d489ed85132b6cafbad40692
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And add to that the rapid industrial advancement currently taking place. I saw men shouting "
"back and forth as they smacked newspaper articles with the backs of their hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E acrescente a isso o rápido avanço industrial que está ocorrendo atualmente. Vi homens "
"gritando de um lado para o outro enquanto batiam em artigos de jornal com as costas das mãos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1
