msgid "⟪k:0⟫I saw corner cafés crowded with cigar-smoking men on break from work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vi cafés de esquina lotados de homens fumando charutos no intervalo do trabalho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
