msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era como a agitação de um festival."

#: scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0429c9a1872131fb824e8c2a27d108d1d998f7160366eafce581ed144fae8d1
