#. native-sha256: 2d550976a774082fdf85cfba426e16e11f29f154e5ae412b6bf010be5c59d2b0
#. default-sha256: d9f2374aabe26eb224d798d5aee34102ed8fdba5025d288250bb502633d19165
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas não foi alívio que se espalhou pelo meu peito ao vê-los—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫foi uma pontada de "
"culpa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1f006afeee40ff9009281496bc9a2f2dc4b2871290fc54a088315e042fb6bf
#. default-sha256: 5da473bd36ce387dcc7a903df268144e2ee0f2a06cc734072a4b344e96bd8a5c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Senti que uma vida de abundância era errada—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫pecaminosa.⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9efc79da6b55243b0c02bc841c7c842a6f4ed90cf13c58efa49b49cffdc1ed6
#. default-sha256: fe6e9cb1516ef2697f289c96ca95af01f3fa658bc201e85af145f2232c91ddb6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Partiu meu coração saber que eu estava vivendo muito melhor do que eles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ca276ebf88214134c1634e2cb9bc241b0918be4bc9a118b2275b7f9e71c68b7
#. default-sha256: f428af589d7d4d4d7bc1e571316d6ec365563987bd596c0b7ef6c8b3e7c8acc7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo, aparentemente lendo minha mente, bufou para mim com desaprovação, e então disse,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 548a37bd1114c681b11deeb0f0bbea4962ef42027128a5aafa8f5059e9246837
#. default-sha256: 3a0e68a8d96bca65056adf446f7006e6b8fc8446ee4bde167a89f7600ffebc33
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O pobre que inveja o rico, cobiça sua riqueza e encontra a ambição de conseguir a sua; e o "
"rico que se compadece dos pobres, pensando ser seu dever dar-lhes migalhas de filantropia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a643742f65bf5547ee87e28e5ea8e4a188187f55d499074ec80d9103d84678
#. default-sha256: 66328f229eb68cfc5bb6d1db3b87443ea7fa5daf1c5055bf6995a44f283c3c2d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Para mim, o último é muito mais nefasto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Caridade excessiva arruina um homem—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫faz com que ele venha a ⟪k:5⟫esperar⟪k:6⟫ esmolas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32dc837aa626cc4e4c2f006d3d6bad7197c2e93593000cfafc44efb9528142b0
#. default-sha256: d8c7361c628bbc74350b04849d5da6c3ad42526df5ed825770cd838d8149d07e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E depois há aqueles com a ideia errada de piedade,⟪k:1⟫que se deixam cair no mesmo lugar,"
"⟪k:2⟫acreditando erroneamente que de alguma forma fará com que os pobres se sintam melhor."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bd2300dfd3c5b9b564e43310f854db405744e946a268967551fafefcb5f8169
#. default-sha256: 03c86b958f56358c70db5c6683ab7ed7c3f3cb92794c5517a2231e67bd7e1c52
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que piada.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se você vai fazer alguma coisa por eles,⟪k:3⟫incentive-os a prosperar."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Estimule o crescimento econômico e o fluxo de capital."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5c254d18fce0eca78974a82db39963cf84ffecb498290b0418efb022b2732e4
#. default-sha256: 118299e08206c76ebb7c9f830e44c11ec4718ae4bf27d11c46b503bcbf5053c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não parece a melhor opção?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 613bede1ad5d48f68effb94de0a00ee0ce2e0f8e42ad48303f76e851c93f7ecf
#. default-sha256: ee20e7176c2e8b539550cd6e6acc74ab7d15b59af1a2e9e1da28de236bb7cd8e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu não disse nada, simplesmente sorri e dei um aceno ambíguo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a661acf70f7c1528736b6916fd4365d8302eec058f31bc781f23a187bc45c69d
#. default-sha256: d0e94f53a9c6300bcb358f33e0072f4c2b8ee92db84ea6ba3c97adcc00745913
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele tinha um ponto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫minha simpatia e culpa não significavam nada para as pessoas "
"que realmente passavam por dificuldades."

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7caf3c3a384a213dbeca19248e9488c4375178e11988bd75da5906236c526afa
#. default-sha256: af690f6f05bb12a8f8507027bbec875acab82491b39627846d1c3dc284e47fb3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se, sentindo-me culpada por minha própria fortuna, eu agisse da maneira que ele havia "
"descrito, isso resultaria em pouco mais do que auto-satisfação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 824f7fcd519fdcd67a9f6c2e1a71911841dea2ce659a064eed9cf499f2fcade5
#. default-sha256: 6125ed1da6d17814d7c67a40b9f34755b7fe9a7f75bbfa71eea6c767d28fc4f3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele parecia ter visto direto no meu âmago."

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1e4f3504f9d5a67ff53145e8f11a3e33aaf6059eac788f5e40d627569c441d6
#. default-sha256: d4eca6d360be60629d161f744d4289be1f8a2784f6ffaae2cee135ea37b30ef1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Este era um homem que construiu sua própria fortuna através de investimentos, o que, "
"imagino, exigia que ele fosse bastante astuto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1144450051587f97f39b3863a3f1ec8f658bc75c321b72672cfe004295f8c08
#. default-sha256: 90426a4ae70688254711879d0a369f488a5fd6238c284164ddd6a209d03efdea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas um mundo onde todos estão constantemente tentando escalar cada vez mais alto não soa... "
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exaustivo?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f36a376ededbdfeda5b2d2ba77a3fda2e295181a55a3432d5abfeee91a5299a
#. default-sha256: 83824ae47c40da84f9f246ee574a3cf7e4b80435b5efc16f292ae80641b4c262
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu, pessoalmente, preferiria estar em uma posição onde pudesse assistir—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫mesmo que "
"à distância—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫enquanto os outros escalavam."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 351d445ad24c30487cf2dc92fd1c2574dfc6280391ed12b92ef79a42142bbd62
#. default-sha256: 117d78825ff32f71222e63ed875bdcfb3fcf67d76d403039b9c57f79d5cc3781
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But obviously, I could not say as much to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas, obviamente, eu não poderia dizer para ele."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abda0a3ad709a0ab12cf9252e5c1d925507380a857b75ec2afa4c382297bde3a
#. default-sha256: 3be309b4f755d451362fe40f6f5c9880e394dfa21a4b2fe6615dffecdd887b29
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Some time later, the carriage came to a stop in front of a shop."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Algum tempo depois, a carruagem parou em frente a uma loja."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d70d5affdac93efb97d29596d40627c0f3041da44b9a529a1a60e7ff2a22eee
#. default-sha256: ccc9fe22a33552326e5d636b710bc4a70d833a614da9608e3b83833cb9f51ef7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I looked at the building perplexedly, he gestured to the door with his chin, signaling "
"for me to get out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Enquanto eu olhava para o prédio perplexa, ele gesticulou para a porta com o queixo, "
"sinalizando para eu sair."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b32052d6196dd4baa5eb5a83dbbf50a6faf0c84457434e33a0badd4550762c6
#. default-sha256: 623176a05991c48d6fa4afab0e71480503fc04b81230729329e185139f61b1d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lost and confused, I stepped down from the carriage,⟪k:1⟫and before me spread a showcase "
"behind a large glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perdida e confusa, desci da carruagem,⟪k:1⟫e diante de mim estendia-se uma vitrine atrás de "
"uma grande janela de vidro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68f399dd37a2fde1284b0bbf5324c8c2d3ded5ce1ed2c4860e71c67a93c65924
#. default-sha256: 557650a2f5fbd5ad612da5a99d1870c69b3d64d7b94c4d5ebdfbda5f00020da9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, lined up in the case were not precious metals or expensive clothing, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"machines."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, não estavam alinhados no mostruário metais preciosos ou roupas caras, ⟪k:1⟫mas "
"máquinas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61aa9b45a54d1b8bb1bfd14f80c3f106851a1a1c4582ea25244711979e8d40e1
#. default-sha256: dbd631ebac3c5fa8d0be439aa17005855bc30cad9e40148fcb4f536b975da1d4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At first, I had no idea what kind of devices they were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No começo, eu não tinha ideia de que tipo de dispositivos eram."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
