msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Você nunca tirou uma foto antes?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3ACF441F_3E8B_4A94_8048_A1BBE4B15EEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de31879804e3c659fb010f2d1e63da8592d163af2e6b1f56f9b0f6efcfea801e
