msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes, photos. ⟪k:1⟫By taking hundreds, or perhaps thousands of photographs, it would be "
"possible to reproduce the world as we see it—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this room, people walking down the streets."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sim, fotos. ⟪k:1⟫Ao tirar centenas, ou talvez milhares de fotografias, seria possível "
"reproduzir o mundo como o vemos—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫esta sala, pessoas andando pelas ruas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61F941F3_DC33_407C_90A1_157D608FF5BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fbaf36a0fe323ebb046fec1a21a9e7aeecd20cdd5bd0bd1373c69596dfad506
