msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫ about knocked me outta my chair!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He’s a man who almost never "
"asks for favors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora, por ⟪k:1⟫isso⟪k:2⟫ quase caí da cadeira!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ele é um homem que quase nunca pede "
"favores."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B2069696_8198_4892_833E_CF906E7D1034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cc0b4808be20d10d5baaba885d2de59c441710641359cd70c0fb3f2d6f3c61a
