"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that moment, the phenakis wheel became a precious treasure to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Naquele momento, a roda fenaquis tornou-se um tesouro precioso para mim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B41298_3DF4_48A0_8D07_D1426C701A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34a581898292fbe708756055f0d866cfd0b6afd88a850617ff40639658cc97de
