msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was filled with a warm, pleasant elation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu estava cheia de uma calorosa e agradável euforia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
