msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I agreed with the owner—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo was not a ⟪k:3⟫bad⟪k:4⟫ man.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He merely had "
"difficulty expressing himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu concordei com o proprietário—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo não era um homem ⟪k:3⟫ruim⟪k:4⟫.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Ele só tinha dificuldade em se expressar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a443bf0dc93e9163a8390888f79e08dae94899d309cf752f131fab194d843b15
