msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hurrying back to the carriage, I gave him my deepest thanks."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Correndo de volta para a carruagem, dei-lhe meus mais profundos agradecimentos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ef2e2f4773f2536f4eaa6546fc1cb7bf7ea44e60b98b60233c2c2b13266bf37
