"⟪k:0⟫He glanced over at me for a moment, then turned back toward the window and muttered, “yeah.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele olhou para mim por um momento, depois se virou para a janela e murmurou: \"Aham\"."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
