msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫De lá, fomos jantar em um restaurante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5135f3e9c6076a4f723c1c08a394c12e53a4768f6b92d890734d71899455933
