msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This wine is pitifully unbalanced! Far too high levels of acidity.⟪k:1⟫Listen to me "
"carefully—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the house wine is the face of a restaurant.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Este vinho é lamentavelmente desequilibrado! Níveis muito altos de acidez.⟪k:1⟫Me escute "
"com atenção—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫o vinho da casa é a cara de um restaurante.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11f29a4861cd5ceb6e4cdff9cc7a38df286b9661c791c6b58daa58f3ef5c7745
