msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quando o sol se pôs, a carruagem seguiu para uma colina próxima."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a813b72c6cde03a9d67cd0eadf3c5e6d40668e3dbe0bf525111dd220b3e76e3
#. default-sha256: 23bc214a4014400c63791a4f622dc21c3126f1b5fe567d4288161b5590df5b7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A brisa fresca da noite era maravilhosa na minha pele, corada pelo álcool, e a luz das "
"lâmpadas a gás tinha um calor reconfortante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3126ab664b92b761550b79c4debdbe6d9cb4bf834d302bb18b7315e4424a1c67
#. default-sha256: 9e569fec25e3cf7f03bbbb974459e22fa530a513f7d9684750282b6ebf97ee02
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora Jacopo tenha se queixado da qualidade do vinho, depois de se embriagar, seu humor "
"melhorou visivelmente. ⟪k:1⟫ Isso o tornou inesperadamente falante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69d44624f8107522d61c01c61f80f3e03c2cb0297b4c861a43f1f1b5016ec4b9
#. default-sha256: 04a5127071c89c0ca5eb8a56d68b84e0debca8a95c5beedf57b2610d5b8efd72
